<title>UK: UK economy healthy and getting stronger - Major.</title>
<headline>UK economy healthy and getting stronger - Major.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Prime Minister John Major said on Sunday the UK economy was healthy and getting stronger.</p>
<p>&quot;The economy is very healthy indeed and getting stronger,&quot; he said in an interview with BBC television.</p>
<p>&quot;We will enter the general election with the best economic prospects that any government has had for generations.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
